Additional permissions
----------------------

In addition to the PolyForm Strict License 1.0.0, the licensor grants these
permissions:

1. You may create, change and delete your own data used with the software —
   characters, voices, memory, recordings and settings in the `user_data` folder —
   and download and use language models of your choice.

2. You may change the configuration files in the `config` folder for your own use,
   for example to add models to the model catalog. This does not permit passing on
   changed copies of the software.


Asking for permission
---------------------

For anything else — changing the code, sharing a changed version, or commercial
use — ask the licensor first, for example by opening an issue at
https://github.com/Slartibart23/local-lantern-talk/issues


Third-party components
